  "description": "Inject raw street culture, bold urban energy, and dynamic layered style into your designs with Gruze! Designed as an eye-catching layered graffiti drip font, it features thick blocky letterforms, authentic paint drips, and multi-layered depth that makes your lettering pop off the page. Its bold bubble-graffiti character delivers an urban street-art vibe that commands immediate focus and gives your visual work an edgy, rebellious attitude.\nIdeal for urban streetwear apparel, hip-hop poster art, skate shop branding, graffiti stickers, music album covers, event flyers, and custom Cricut or Silhouette craft SVG projects!",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Inject raw street culture, bold urban energy, and dynamic layered style into your designs with Gruze! Designed as an eye-catching layered graffiti drip font, it features thick blocky letterforms, authentic paint drips, and multi-layered depth that makes your lettering pop off the page. Its bold bubble-graffiti character delivers an urban street-art vibe that commands immediate focus and gives your visual work an edgy, rebellious attitude.</p>\n<p>Ideal for urban streetwear apparel, hip-hop poster art, skate shop branding, graffiti stickers, music album covers, event flyers, and custom Cricut or Silhouette craft SVG projects!</p>",
